{"seq":2,"slug":"formik-final-form","title":"Formik 与 Final Form","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/libraries/formik-final-form","wordCount":1288,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"formik-与-final-form\">Formik 与 Final Form</h1><p>Formik 和 React Final Form 是 React Hook Form 之前的两代表单库王者。Formik 开创了&quot;表单即状态管理&quot;的声明式范式，Final Form 用订阅机制解决了 Formik 的性能问题。理解它们不只是考古——7M 周下载量的 Formik 仍运行在大量生产系统中，而 Final Form 的设计理念直接影响了后来者。本文剖析两者的核心架构、已知痛点，以及从它们迁移到现代方案的路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Formik 与 React Final Form 的差别，本质是<strong>订阅粒度</strong>的差别。Formik 把整个表单状态放进一个 Context Provider，任何字段变化都会更新 Context value，所有 Consumer 一起重渲染，重渲染次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；Final Form 把状态放在一个框架无关的 core 里，React 适配层通过 <code>subscription</code> prop 让每个组件只订阅它需要的切片，重渲染次数降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\leq n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）。Conform 则代表了第三极——不维护 JavaScript 对象状态，直接操作 <code>FormData</code> 并依赖 Server Action，把校验重心移到服务端。三者的选型取决于表单跑在客户端还是服务端为主。</p>\n<h2 id=\"formik-受控组件的极致\">Formik：受控组件的极致</h2><h3 id=\"核心架构\">核心架构</h3><p>Formik 将表单视为一个纯状态管理问题——整个表单状态存活在一个 Context Provider 中：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Formik Provider] --&gt; B[values state]&#10;    A --&gt; C[errors state]&#10;    A --&gt; D[touched state]&#10;    A --&gt; E[isSubmitting state]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Consumer 组件树]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Field A]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Field B]&#10;    F --&gt; I[Field N]&#10;    B -- setState --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[Formik Provider] --&gt; B[values state]\n    A --&gt; C[errors state]\n    A --&gt; D[touched state]\n    A --&gt; E[isSubmitting state]\n    A --&gt; F[Consumer 组件树]\n    F --&gt; G[Field A]\n    F --&gt; H[Field B]\n    F --&gt; I[Field N]\n    B -- setState --&gt; F</pre><p>每次任何字段变化，<code>values</code> 对象整体更新，触发 Context 的所有 Consumer 重渲染。这是 Formik 最根本的性能瓶颈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"formik-的-api-模式\">Formik 的 API 模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Formik, Form, Field, ErrorMessage } from &#39;formik&#39;&#10;&#10;function LoginForm() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Formik&#10;      initialValues={{ email: &#39;&#39;, password: &#39;&#39; }}&#10;      validationSchema={yupSchema}&#10;      onSubmit={async (values, { setSubmitting }) =&gt; {&#10;        await login(values)&#10;        setSubmitting(false)&#10;      }}&#10;    &gt;&#10;      {({ isSubmitting }) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;Form&gt;&#10;          &lt;Field name=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; /&gt;&#10;          &lt;ErrorMessage name=&quot;email&quot; component=&quot;span&quot; /&gt;&#10;          &lt;Field name=&quot;password&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; /&gt;&#10;          &lt;ErrorMessage name=&quot;password&quot; component=&quot;span&quot; /&gt;&#10;          &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; disabled={isSubmitting}&gt;登录&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Form&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    &lt;/Formik&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Formik, Form, Field, ErrorMessage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'formik'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Formik</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      initialValues</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      validationSchema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{yupSchema}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">setSubmitting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        setSubmitting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">isSubmitting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Field name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ErrorMessage name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"span\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Field name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ErrorMessage name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"span\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{isSubmitting}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">登录</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">button</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Formik</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&lt;Field&gt;</code> 组件内部使用 <code>connect</code> HOC 订阅 Formik Context。每个 Field 在任何字段变化时都会重渲染——因为 Context value 是整个 formik state 对象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"formik-的已知痛点\">Formik 的已知痛点</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全表单重渲染</td>\n<td>Context 无 selector 机制</td>\n<td>20+ 字段时性能劣化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript 支持弱</td>\n<td>早期设计未考虑完整类型推导</td>\n<td><code>Field</code> 的 name 无类型检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步校验竞态</td>\n<td>无内建 debounce/cancel</td>\n<td>需手动处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>12.7KB gzipped</td>\n<td>比 RHF 大 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护频率下降</td>\n<td>2023 年后更新缓慢</td>\n<td>安全补丁风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fastfield-局部优化尝试\">FastField：局部优化尝试</h3><p>Formik 提供 <code>&lt;FastField&gt;</code> 作为性能优化——它仅在自身 name 对应的 <code>values[name]</code>、<code>errors[name]</code>、<code>touched[name]</code> 变化时重渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"&lt;FastField name=&quot;email&quot;&gt;&#10;  {({ field, meta }: FieldProps) =&gt; (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input {...field} /&gt;&#10;      {meta.touched &amp;&amp; meta.error &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;{meta.error}&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  )}&#10;&lt;/FastField&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FastField name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldProps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">touched</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FastField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><p>但 <code>FastField</code> 有严格限制：它无法感知跨字段依赖（如 confirmPassword 需要读取 password 值）。一旦使用了 <code>values</code> 或 <code>setFieldValue</code> 等全局方法，优化即失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"react-final-form-订阅模型\">React Final Form：订阅模型</h2><h3 id=\"核心架构\">核心架构</h3><p>Final Form 的核心是一个独立于 React 的状态管理库（<code>final-form</code>），React 适配层（<code>react-final-form</code>）通过订阅模式连接 React 组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Form, Field } from &#39;react-final-form&#39;&#10;&#10;function RegistrationForm() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Form&#10;      onSubmit={handleSubmit}&#10;      subscription={{ submitting: true, pristine: true }}&#10;      render={({ handleSubmit, submitting, pristine }) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;form onSubmit={handleSubmit}&gt;&#10;          &lt;Field&#10;            name=&quot;email&quot;&#10;            subscription={{ value: true, error: true, touched: true }}&#10;            render={({ input, meta }) =&gt; (&#10;              &lt;div&gt;&#10;                &lt;input {...input} /&gt;&#10;                {meta.touched &amp;&amp; meta.error &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;{meta.error}&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;              &lt;/div&gt;&#10;            )}&#10;          /&gt;&#10;          &lt;button disabled={submitting || pristine}&gt;提交&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;/form&gt;&#10;      )}&#10;    /&gt;&#10;  )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Form, Field } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-final-form'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RegistrationForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Form</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleSubmit}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      subscription</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">submitting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pristine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      render</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{({ handleSubmit, submitting, pristine }) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;form onSubmit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{handleSubmit}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          &#x3C;Field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1